OL,1,Vk4                              G10/18
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGTHREE YOUNG BROTHERS
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGARE FOUND DEAD
OL,4,D
OL,5, Three young brothers have been found
OL,6, dead in a disused freezer at their home
OL,7, near Ludlow, Shropshire.
OL,9,FThe three were Benjamin, 6, Nicky, 4,
OL,10,Fand Ryan, 3. They apparently became
OL,11,Ftrapped while playing and suffocated.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FParents Derek Broome and Shirley Dovey
OL,14,Fraised the alarm at 1700 yesterday when
OL,15,Fthe brothers failed to appear for tea.
OL,17,FA police officer searching an old stock
OL,18,Fwagon in outbuildings at their home in
OL,19,FClee Hill found the bodies at 1930.
OL,21,FPost mortems will take place tomorrow.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG11-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
